@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 05. Host Agent LangGraph4J Orchestration

skinparam shadowing false

start

:Request validated;
:Load history/checkpoint;
:Build HostGraphState;
:Invoke CompiledGraph;

:PLAN_INTENT node;
:SELECT_DOWNSTREAM node;

if (routing plan exists?) then (yes)
  :CALL_A2A node;
  if (more plans?) then (yes)
    :loop next routing plan;
  endif
else (no)
endif

:MERGE_RESULTS node;
:COMPOSE_RESPONSE node;
:Persist history/checkpoint;

stop

note right
Graph contract
- nodes: plan, select, invoke, merge, compose
- edge: select -> (invoke|compose)
- invoke loop has max iteration guard
- downstream call boundary is A2A only
end note

@enduml
